{"audio":{"src":"https://pub-13abeb101e2945d2a7f60234f6faf52e.r2.dev/materials/a2-disney-california-adventure-one-day/audio/main-264cab0a751f.mp3","durationSec":248.976,"cues":[{"start":0,"end":0.88,"text":"It is 8:00 a.m."},{"start":1.3,"end":3.22,"text":"You and Hana walk up to the main gate."},{"start":3.64,"end":5.14,"text":"Before you go in, look up."},{"start":5.62,"end":8.06,"text":"The gate building has a big, rounded shape."},{"start":8.56,"end":12.06,"text":"It looks like the Pan-Pacific Auditorium, a famous old building."},{"start":12.68,"end":16.12,"text":"When the park rebuilt this area, it moved the main gate further out."},{"start":16.58,"end":19.28,"text":"So the gate now stands in front of a whole new street."},{"start":19.86,"end":23.32,"text":"That street is Buena Vista Street, and it is the first thing you see inside."},{"start":23.32,"end":27.28,"text":"Hana points to a red car moving slowly down the street."},{"start":27.7,"end":31.44,"text":"This is the Red Car Trolley, and it runs along Buena Vista Street."},{"start":32.16,"end":33.38,"text":"She wants to ride it right away."},{"start":33.98,"end":36.34,"text":"You smile and say, \"Later.\""},{"start":36.34,"end":39.38,"text":"First, you want to plan the rides while the morning is still quiet."},{"start":40.18,"end":41.3,"text":"At 9:00 a.m.,"},{"start":41.3,"end":42.72,"text":"you walk into Cars Land."},{"start":43.46,"end":46.86,"text":"Radiator Springs Racers comes from the 2006 film Cars."},{"start":47.58,"end":49.18,"text":"Six people sit in one car."},{"start":49.74,"end":52.92,"text":"Your car races another car, and the winner is random."},{"start":53.44,"end":54.74,"text":"You cannot plan to win."},{"start":55.28,"end":57.42,"text":"The ride was also very expensive to build."},{"start":57.42,"end":62.76,"text":"It is the most expensive attraction at Disneyland Resort and one of the most expensive in the world."},{"start":62.76,"end":67.42,"text":"Before you join the line, check the height sign at the entrance or in the app."},{"start":67.42,"end":70.26,"text":"Hana stands next to it to make sure."},{"start":70.84,"end":72.14,"text":"At 10:30 a.m.,"},{"start":72.14,"end":75.98,"text":"you reach Guardians of the Galaxy – Mission: Breakout!"},{"start":76.78,"end":80.8,"text":"Riders must be at least 40 inches (102 cm) tall."},{"start":81.3,"end":85.66,"text":"But the park warns that this ride has big drops, and it is loud and scary."},{"start":86.05,"end":88.54,"text":"The park says it is best for teens and adults."},{"start":89.08,"end":90.64,"text":"So you must decide as her parent."},{"start":90.64,"end":95.56,"text":"Next comes the Incredicoaster, a fast steel roller coaster."},{"start":96.08,"end":98.82,"text":"It launches forward instead of slowly climbing up."},{"start":99.36,"end":103.74,"text":"It is the only coaster at Disneyland Resort that turns riders upside down."},{"start":104.2,"end":110.78,"text":"It is also the fastest, at 55 mph (about 89 km/h)."},{"start":110.78,"end":114.5,"text":"Riders must be at least 48 inches (122 cm) tall."},{"start":115.06,"end":117.06,"text":"Lines can be long at busy rides."},{"start":118.14,"end":119.9,"text":"You may also hear the name Lightning Lane."},{"start":120.72,"end":123.18,"text":"Before you pay for anything, open the app."},{"start":124.56,"end":127.78,"text":"Read what Lightning Lane offers and what it costs on that day."},{"start":129.89,"end":132.61,"text":"You go to Corn Dog Castle, a snack stand."},{"start":133.27,"end":136.39,"text":"Its cheese stick is one of the park's most popular snacks."},{"start":137.31,"end":141.27,"text":"The park does not print one price for everyone online, so look first."},{"start":142.09,"end":145.69,"text":"Before you order, check the price on the menu board or in the Disneyland app."},{"start":147.74,"end":150.14,"text":"You can also order and pay for food in the app."},{"start":150.9,"end":152.8,"text":"That can save time when the stand is busy."},{"start":153.64,"end":155.84,"text":"Today you order at the counter so Hana can watch."},{"start":156.52,"end":158.2,"text":"There are bigger meals in the park too."},{"start":158.66,"end":161.66,"text":"Some guests make dining reservations for a sit-down lunch."},{"start":162.12,"end":167.06,"text":"But for a fast snack between rides, a stand like Corn Dog Castle works well."},{"start":168.12,"end":169.28,"text":"At 3:00 p.m.,"},{"start":169.28,"end":170.48,"text":"you walk into a gift shop."},{"start":170.48,"end":172.84,"text":"Hana goes straight to the ear headbands."},{"start":173.26,"end":175.78,"text":"These are the famous Mickey and Minnie ears."},{"start":175.78,"end":182.4,"text":"A news report from October 2026 says these headbands now cost about $38.99."},{"start":183.34,"end":187.12,"text":"Before the price increase, they cost $36.99."},{"start":187.98,"end":190.62,"text":"That is not cheap, so you think before you buy."},{"start":191.28,"end":194.74,"text":"One headband costs about $38.99."},{"start":195.54,"end":199.36,"text":"Two headbands cost about $77.98."},{"start":200.04,"end":203.72,"text":"Maybe Hana gets one pair, and you take photos of her wearing them."},{"start":204.58,"end":208.82,"text":"For a small gift for her friend at home, look at the price tag on each item."},{"start":209.3,"end":210.92,"text":"Then compare before you choose."},{"start":211.38,"end":216.04,"text":"The park has character meet and greets with Mickey and others, along with parades and shows."},{"start":216.86,"end":218.58,"text":"Before the show, Hana meets Mickey."},{"start":218.94,"end":220.18,"text":"She shows him her new ears."},{"start":221.06,"end":223.28,"text":"The big evening show is World of Color."},{"start":224.16,"end":227.94,"text":"The time can change from day to day, so check it in the Disneyland app."},{"start":228.78,"end":230.5,"text":"Then find your place early."},{"start":230.5,"end":233.38,"text":"Hana sits on your lap, tired but excited."},{"start":234.08,"end":236.26,"text":"When the show ends, you walk back to the gate."},{"start":237.02,"end":239.64,"text":"Buena Vista Street is lit up at night, and Hana is quiet now."},{"start":240.24,"end":242.42,"text":"You pass the spot where the Red Car Trolley runs."},{"start":243.06,"end":245.3,"text":"You walk out under the big, rounded gate."},{"start":245.76,"end":248.48,"text":"She is holding your hand again, just like this morning."}],"words":[{"text":"It","start":0,"end":0.14},{"text":"is","start":0.14,"end":0.26},{"text":"8","start":0.26,"end":0.5},{"text":"00","start":0.5,"end":0.51},{"text":"a","start":0.5,"end":0.64},{"text":"m","start":0.64,"end":0.88},{"text":"You","start":1.3,"end":1.52},{"text":"and","start":1.52,"end":1.7},{"text":"Hana","start":1.7,"end":1.9},{"text":"walk","start":1.9,"end":2.16},{"text":"up","start":2.16,"end":2.36},{"text":"to","start":2.36,"end":2.5},{"text":"the","start":2.5,"end":2.62},{"text":"main","start":2.62,"end":2.86},{"text":"gate","start":2.86,"end":3.22},{"text":"Before","start":3.64,"end":3.92},{"text":"you","start":3.92,"end":4.1},{"text":"go","start":4.1,"end":4.24},{"text":"in","start":4.24,"end":4.52},{"text":"look","start":4.76,"end":4.86},{"text":"up","start":4.86,"end":5.14},{"text":"The","start":5.62,"end":5.72},{"text":"gate","start":5.72,"end":5.92},{"text":"building","start":5.92,"end":6.26},{"text":"has","start":6.26,"end":6.5},{"text":"a","start":6.5,"end":6.7},{"text":"big","start":6.7,"end":7.04},{"text":"rounded","start":7.16,"end":7.62},{"text":"shape","start":7.62,"end":8.06},{"text":"It","start":8.56,"end":8.66},{"text":"looks","start":8.66,"end":8.86},{"text":"like","start":8.86,"end":9.12},{"text":"the","start":9.12,"end":9.28},{"text":"Pan-Pacific","start":9.28,"end":10.04},{"text":"Auditorium","start":10.04,"end":10.76},{"text":"a","start":10.98,"end":11.12},{"text":"famous","start":11.12,"end":11.44},{"text":"old","start":11.44,"end":11.66},{"text":"building","start":11.66,"end":12.06},{"text":"